  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">RPSC PRO Answer Key 2025</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2025-05-27T16:24:03+05:30\">May 27, 2025</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">4:24 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/\"><strong>Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</strong></a> has released the <strong>Answer Key</strong> for the recruitment of <strong>Public</strong> <strong>Relation Officer PRO (Jan Sampark Adhikari)</strong>\u00a0on its <strong>official website.</strong> The <strong>RPSC</strong> application process started on <strong data-end=\"339\" data-start=\"319\">05 March 2024</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their applications until <strong data-end=\"424\" data-start=\"401\">03 April 2024</strong>. The exam was scheduled to be conducted in <strong data-end=\"486\" data-start=\"467\">17 May 2025</strong>. Candidates can check\u00a0their <strong>Answer Key</strong>\u00a0by logging into the portal (link provided below) using their <strong data-end=\"679\" data-start=\"619\">Registration Number, Date of Birth, or Enrollment Number</strong>.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: cent