tails</h3>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/rpsc-pro-answer-key-2025/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>05 March 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>03 April 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <b>03 April 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date<strong> : 17 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :\u00a0<strong>09 May 2025\u00a0</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer Key Date : 27 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <b>RPSC </b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>General, Other State</strong> :<strong> \u20b9 600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>OBC, BC</strong>\u00a0: <strong>\u20b9</strong><strong> 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC, ST</strong>\u00a0:<strong> \u20b9 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>Correction Charge</strong> : <strong>\u20b9 </strong><strong>500</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">RPSC PRO Notification 2024 : Age Limits As On 01 January 2025</h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age:\u00a0\u00a0<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age:\u00a0<strong>40 Years\u00a0</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>RPSC </b>provides age relaxation for the <strong>PRO </strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">06 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/